# Push live

After finishing a user-requested change, commit it and `git push origin HEAD` without asking.

- Do not wait for "push live" or "is it live?"
- Follow the repo commit-message style (why, not a file dump)
- Never force-push `main` / `master`
- Still skip secrets (`.env`, credentials)
- If commit or push fails, fix it and retry; do not leave the work unpushed
